The source is "abcdefg".
The span is 2.
Keep a shared letters as an empty list of text.
The last is the last position of source.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The piece is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
Place piece into letters.

To mirror from left (a whole number) with right (a whole number).
Repeat while left is less than right.
swap item left of letters and item right of letters.
Add 1 to left.
Subtract 1 from right.

The start is 0.
Repeat while start is at most last.
The finish is start plus span minus 1.
If finish is more than last, set finish to last.
Mirror from start with finish.
Set start to start plus span plus span.

The result is join letters with "".
Show result.
